#: src/plugin.c:130
#, c-format
msgid "Procedure '%s' only works with one drawable."
msgstr ""

#. Tool-tips
#: src/plugin.h:30
msgid "Adjusts the amount of sharpening applied."
msgstr "Reguleerib teravustamise tugevust."

#: src/plugin.h:31
msgid ""
"Adjusts the radius of the sharpening. For very unsharp images it is "
"recommended to use higher values. Default is 0.5."
msgstr ""
"Sätestab teravustamise raadiuse. Väga udustele piltidele on soovitatav "
"suurem raadus. Standard on 0.5."

#: src/plugin.h:32
msgid ""
"Sharpens luminance only (YCbCr luminance channel). This avoids color "
"artifacts to appear and makes the sharpening faster. Colour sharpness in "
"natural images is not critical for the human eye."
msgstr ""
"Teravustab Luminessantsi ainult (YCbCr värviruum). See hoiab ära artifaktide "
"tekkimist ja teravustab kiremini. Värviteravus loomulikel piltidel ei ole "
"inimese silmale väga segav."

